{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"Battle Cry","artist":"Beth Crowley","date":"2026-07-20","sourceId":"UBCB2e0Aik4:029","sourceHash":"9a6fee3af8089a0e2049d20f8b4f620ceb19c86648713851c868d2c7933f92ab","duration":262.03,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":18.88,"end":23.14,"text":"I have no heart, just ice and stone","translation":"내게 심장은 없어 얼음과 돌뿐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":26.04,"end":30.46,"text":"Made up of nails and teeth and bone","translation":"못과 이빨과 뼈로 만들어졌어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":32.88,"end":37.34,"text":"And I know exactly what I'm for","translation":"내가 무엇을 위해 있는지 정확히 알아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":40.3,"end":44.54,"text":"To hurt and destroy and nothing more","translation":"상처 입히고 파괴하는 것 그뿐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":46.88,"end":51.72,"text":"And if it's true that I was made","translation":"내가 그렇게 만들어진 게 사실이라 해도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":54.01,"end":58.88,"text":"I still don't know if I can change","translation":"내가 변할 수 있을지는 아직 몰라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":61.06,"end":63.86,"text":"But something has stirred","translation":"하지만 무언가 꿈틀거렸어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":63.86,"end":65.88,"text":"A beast has awakened","translation":"짐승 하나가 깨어났어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":66.3,"end":67.84,"text":"Opened a door","translation":"문 하나를 열었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":67.84,"end":70.3,"text":"There's no mistaking","translation":"틀림없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":70.3,"end":71.86,"text":"Waging a war","translation":"전쟁을 벌이며","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":71.86,"end":75.54,"text":"It's fighting inside of me","translation":"내 안에서 싸우고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":77.2,"end":82.04,"text":"So hear my battle cry","translation":"그러니 내 전투의 외침을 들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":82.3,"end":85.84,"text":"I'm out for blood to claim what's mine","translation":"내 것을 되찾으려 피를 보러 나섰어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":85.84,"end":89.62,"text":"Finally questioning","translation":"마침내 묻기 시작해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":90.1,"end":92.72,"text":"If I am my own worst","translation":"내 최악의 적이 나 자신인지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":92.72,"end":94.58,"text":"I am my own worst","translation":"내가 내 최악의 적","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":94.58,"end":97.56,"text":"I am my own worst enemy","translation":"내가 바로 내 최악의 적이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":100.3,"end":105.7,"text":"I never thought that I could love","translation":"내가 사랑할 수 있으리라곤 생각도 못 했어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":108.46,"end":112.68,"text":"Strangers at night were good enough","translation":"밤의 낯선 이들로도 충분했지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":114.92,"end":120.0,"text":"But love's not a thing you get to choose","translation":"하지만 사랑은 네가 고를 수 있는 게 아니야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":120.2,"end":126.98,"text":"Try to resist, you'll always lose","translation":"저항해 봐도 언제나 지게 돼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":129.06,"end":134.18,"text":"I made a deal to sell my soul","translation":"내 영혼을 파는 거래를 했어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":135.98,"end":141.18,"text":"But lately, I have dared to hope","translation":"하지만 요즘은 감히 희망을 품었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":143.26,"end":146.16,"text":"That something has stirred","translation":"무언가 꿈틀거렸어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":146.16,"end":147.9,"text":"A beast has awakened","translation":"짐승 하나가 깨어났어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":147.9,"end":150.2,"text":"Opened a door","translation":"문 하나를 열었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":150.2,"end":152.24,"text":"There's no mistaking","translation":"틀림없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":152.24,"end":154.26,"text":"Waging a war","translation":"전쟁을 벌이며","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":154.26,"end":157.82,"text":"It's fighting inside of me","translation":"내 안에서 싸우고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":159.38,"end":164.04,"text":"So hear my battle cry","translation":"그러니 내 전투의 외침을 들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":164.04,"end":168.28,"text":"I'm out for blood to claim what's mine","translation":"내 것을 되찾으려 피를 보러 나섰어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":168.28,"end":171.98,"text":"Finally questioning","translation":"마침내 묻기 시작해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":172.16,"end":174.86,"text":"If I am my own worst","translation":"내 최악의 적이 나 자신인지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":174.86,"end":176.88,"text":"I am my own worst","translation":"내가 내 최악의 적","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":176.88,"end":180.14,"text":"I am my own worst enemy","translation":"내가 바로 내 최악의 적이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":183.74,"end":188.5,"text":"Tell my secrets to the wind","translation":"내 비밀을 바람에게 들려줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":191.06,"end":194.72,"text":"Flying, I feel infinite","translation":"날아오르며 나는 끝없이 펼쳐져","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":194.72,"end":198.7,"text":"But something has stirred","translation":"하지만 무언가 꿈틀거렸어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":200.16,"end":202.3,"text":"A beast has awakened","translation":"짐승 하나가 깨어났어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":202.3,"end":203.96,"text":"Opened a door","translation":"문 하나를 열었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":203.96,"end":206.38,"text":"There's no mistaking","translation":"틀림없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":206.38,"end":207.86,"text":"Waging a war","translation":"전쟁을 벌이며","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":207.86,"end":211.78,"text":"It's fighting inside of me","translation":"내 안에서 싸우고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":213.42,"end":217.9,"text":"So hear my battle cry","translation":"그러니 내 전투의 외침을 들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":217.9,"end":222.18,"text":"I'm out for blood to claim what's mine","translation":"내 것을 되찾으려 피를 보러 나섰어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":222.18,"end":225.88,"text":"Finally questioning","translation":"마침내 묻기 시작해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":226.38,"end":228.78,"text":"If I am my own worst","translation":"내 최악의 적이 나 자신인지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":228.78,"end":230.8,"text":"I am my own worst","translation":"내가 내 최악의 적","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":230.8,"end":234.06,"text":"I am my own worst enemy","translation":"내가 바로 내 최악의 적이야","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}